NOTE ON THE DATASETS

The CSV files under `data/` are synthetic and/or derived from publicly
available restaurant listings. They contain no real customer records: names,
e-mail addresses, passwords and order histories are machine-generated. The MIT
licence above covers the code, SQL, infrastructure definitions and
documentation in this repository. The datasets are provided for educational
and portfolio use only and carry no warranty of accuracy.
